<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: hemophage warcasket -->
  <HPWC_Warcasket_Hemophage.label>噬血型战棺装甲</HPWC_Warcasket_Hemophage.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket shell with improved heat protection, equipped with hemogen injectors that replace the pilot's blood pumping and can spend hemogen to make the pilot faster and stronger. -->
  <HPWC_Warcasket_Hemophage.shortDescription>特化型太空时代级别战棺装甲，热能护甲经过强化，另装有血原质注射器。注射器可接管驾驶员的血液循环，还能消耗血原质让驾驶员变得更快、更强。</HPWC_Warcasket_Hemophage.shortDescription>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket shell with improved heat protection, equipped with hemogen injectors that replace the pilot's blood pumping and can spend hemogen to make the pilot faster and stronger.\n\nThe 10th generation came out of a government program that rebuilt captured pirate rigs around its own power armor and gave them to veterans who could no longer serve any other way. The program has no record of a Hemophage series. Some think the designs were stolen and refitted by sanguophages. Some believe the series was sanctioned in secret from the top of the program, which sanguophages had directed all along.\n\nThe Hemophage series runs on its pilot's hemogen. Injectors in the shell keep the pilot's blood pumping even without a heart, and can spend hemogen quickly to make the pilot much faster and stronger. Servos in the pauldrons can tear a limb off an enemy so the pilot can drain hemogen from the wound, and the helmet keeps out sunlight and helps the pilot hold their nerve near fire. For a non-hemogenic pilot this series is somewhat lackluster, but it suits a sanguophage who prefers to fight up close. -->
  <HPWC_Warcasket_Hemophage.description>特化型太空时代级别战棺装甲，热能护甲经过强化，另装有血原质注射器。注射器可接管驾驶员的血液循环，还能消耗血原质让驾驶员变得更快、更强。\n\n第十代战棺出自一项政府项目。该项目用自家的动力装甲改造收缴来的海盗装备，交给那些除此之外再也无法服役的老兵。项目档案中没有任何关于噬血型的记录。有些人认为，是血族窃取了设计并加以改装。也有人猜测，这个项目自始至终都由血族在高层掌控，这一型号正是他们暗中批准的。\n\n噬血型以驾驶员的血原质为动力。即使驾驶员没有心脏，装甲内的注射器也能维持其血液循环，还能快速消耗血原质，让驾驶员的速度和力量大幅提升。护肩的伺服马达能撕下敌人的肢体，让驾驶员从伤口抽取血原质。头盔能挡住日光，还能帮助驾驶员在火焰附近保持镇定。对于没有血原化基因的驾驶员来说，这套战棺有些差强人意，但很适合偏爱近身作战的血族。</HPWC_Warcasket_Hemophage.description>
  <!-- EN: hemophage warcasket shoulders -->
  <HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.label>噬血型战棺护肩</HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket pauldrons with improved heat protection, equipped with powerful servos and reinforced arms that can tear a limb off an enemy. -->
  <HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.shortDescription>特化型太空时代级别战棺护肩，热能护甲经过强化，另装有强力伺服马达和强化机械臂，可以撕下敌人的肢体。</HPWC_WarcasketShoulders_Hemophage.shortDescription>
