  <!-- EN: hemophage warcasket helmet -->
  <HPWC_WarcasketHelmet_Hemophage.label>噬血型战棺头盔</HPWC_WarcasketHelmet_Hemophage.label>
  <!-- EN: Specialized spacer-tech warcasket helmet with improved impact dispersion and heat protection, equipped with a visor that shields the pilot from sunlight and makes them less likely to flee from fire. -->
  <HPWC_WarcasketHelmet_Hemophage.shortDescription>特化型太空时代级别战棺头盔，配备改进型冲击力偏转模块，热能护甲也经过强化，另装有面罩。面罩可为驾驶员挡住日光，也能降低其因火焰而逃跑的几率。</HPWC_WarcasketHelmet_Hemophage.shortDescription>
